* ''The first fleet offer founds the face'' (controller ruling, 2026-11-12, overrulable). A leaf at its veil floor that offers a fleet join holds no face yet; the offer act founds the face first, through the same one-boot ask the identity panel's founding door carries, and then offers it. Owed in #/the-leaps.

